      "position": 2,
      "content": "Cal Poly Humboldt's Spanish B.A. Program is composed of upper division courses only. Preparation: A good background in English grammar and syntax is desirable. Previous Spanish study is welcomed but not required. Residency Abroad Requirement: Complete an approved academic semester program abroad in a Spanish-speaking region of the Hispanic World. Contact the department for further information: www.humboldt.edu/wlc",
      "contentHtml": "<p><a href=\"https://catalog.humboldt.edu/preview_program.php?catoid=10&amp;poid=5992&amp;returnto=1615\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Cal Poly Humboldt's Spanish B.A. Program</a> is composed of upper division courses only. Preparation: A good background in English grammar and syntax is desirable. Previous Spanish study is welcomed but not required. Residency Abroad Requirement: Complete an approved academic semester program abroad in a Spanish-speaking region of the Hispanic World. Contact the department for further information: <a href=\"https://www.humboldt.edu/wlc\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">www.humboldt.edu/wlc</a></p>"
